---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Chi siamo | Tinaba"
  description="Tinaba di Banca Profilo integra tecnologia, servizi bancari e strumenti digitali in un’unica esperienza."
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="contenuto">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <a class="back-link" href="/">← Torna alla home</a>
          <p class="eyebrow">Il nostro mondo</p>
          <h1>Tutto per il tuo denaro,<br /><em>in una sola App.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">
            Dall’integrazione tra i prodotti bancari e finanziari offerti da Banca Profilo
            e le competenze tecnologiche di Tinaba nasce un’esperienza digitale semplice,
            chiara e completa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <picture class="hero-art">
          <source media="(max-width: 760px)" srcset="/assets/about/header-chi-siamo-mobile.png" />
          <img src="/assets/about/header-chi-siamo.png" alt="Il mondo di servizi disponibili nell’App Tinaba" />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-wrap split-section" aria-labelledby="unique-title">
      <div class="split-art"><img src="/assets/about/mockup-piramide.png" alt="L’App Tinaba riunisce conto, carta, risparmi e condivisione" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Una piattaforma aperta</p>
        <h2 id="unique-title">Unici,<br /><em>non esclusivi.</em></h2>
        <p>
          Vogliamo consentire a chiunque di gestire ciò che riguarda il denaro da un’unica
          App, accedendo ai prodotti e ai servizi offerti da Banca Profilo.
        </p>
        <p>
          Il nostro ecosistema è aperto, trasparente, in continua evoluzione e interconnesso.
          Tinaba porta tecnologia e servizi a valore aggiunto nell’esperienza bancaria,
          mantenendo chiari i ruoli: Banca Profilo è il soggetto bancario; Tinaba abilita
          la piattaforma e l’esperienza digitale.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
      <div class="about-wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Il modo in cui lavoriamo</p>
          <h2 id="principles-title">Ci distinguiamo<br /><em>per questo.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-grid">
          <article><img src="/assets/about/mondo.svg" alt="" /><h3>Interconnessione</h3><p>Un ecosistema che mette in relazione servizi bancari, investimenti, pagamenti e retail banking.</p></article>
          <article><img src="/assets/about/accordo.svg" alt="" /><h3>Collaborazione</h3><p>La gestione condivisa, in tempo reale e collaborativa del denaro tra persone.</p></article>
          <article><img src="/assets/about/pagamenti-misti.svg" alt="" /><h3>Omnicanalità</h3><p>Esperienze online e offline sinergiche, con la persona al centro e non il metodo di pagamento.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-wrap community-section" aria-labelledby="community-title">
      <div class="community-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Una community che cresce</p>
        <h2 id="community-title">Il denaro funziona meglio<br /><em>quando crea connessioni.</em></h2>
        <p>Una community coesa e curiosa, che ogni giorno scopre nuovi modi per gestire, condividere e vivere il denaro.</p>
        <a class="button" href="https://onboarding.bancaprofilo.it/#/">Entra nella community <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="community-art"><img src="/assets/about/team.png" alt="Persone della community Tinaba riunite intorno al logo" loading="lazy" /></div>
    </section>

    <section class="team-section" aria-labelledby="team-title">
      <div class="about-wrap team-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Lavora con noi</p>
        <h2 id="team-title">Le grandi sfide richiedono<br /><em>persone ambiziose.</em></h2>
        <p>Crediamo nel motto “pochi ma buoni”: persone motivate, grintose, aperte alle nuove sfide e con il desiderio di guidare il cambiamento.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="mailto:careers@tinaba.it">Scopri le posizioni aperte <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-wrap { width: min(76rem, calc(100% - 3rem)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .about-hero { overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper-strong); }
  .hero-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; min-height: 39rem; }
  .hero-copy { padding-block: 4rem; }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 5rem; color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent-dark); }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--accent-dark); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2 { letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: .98; } h1 { max-width: 11ch; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6.5vw, 6.5rem); } h2 { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem); } em { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }
  .hero-lead { max-width: 31rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .hero-art { display: grid; align-self: stretch; padding: 2rem 0; place-items: center; } .hero-art img { display: block; width: 88%; max-width: 42rem; max-height: 32rem; object-fit: contain; }
  .split-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: center; padding-block: 8rem; } .split-art img { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 35rem; } .split-copy { max-width: 34rem; } .split-copy p:not(.eyebrow), .community-copy > p:not(.eyebrow), .team-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .principles { padding-block: 7rem; background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); } .principles .eyebrow { color: #ffb08a; } .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; } .section-heading h2 { margin: 0; }
  .principle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; } .principle-grid article { min-height: 18rem; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / .22); border-radius: 1rem; } .principle-grid img { width: 4rem; height: 4rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; } .principle-grid h3 { margin: 0 0 .7rem; font-size: 1.4rem; } .principle-grid p { margin: 0; color: #cbd7dc; line-height: 1.6; }
  .community-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 5rem; align-items: center; padding-block: 8rem; } .community-copy { max-width: 35rem; } .community-art { padding: 1rem; background: var(--paper-strong); } .community-art img { display: block; width: 100%; } .button { display: inline-flex; gap: .7rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; padding: .9rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; } .button:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }
  .team-section { padding-block: 7rem; background: var(--paper-strong); } .team-copy { max-width: 52rem; text-align: center; } .team-copy .eyebrow { text-align: center; } .team-copy h2 { margin-inline: auto; } .team-copy > p { max-width: 42rem; margin-inline: auto; } .text-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .6rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--accent); text-underline-offset: .25rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about-wrap { width: min(100% - 2rem, 40rem); } .hero-inner, .split-section, .community-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; } .hero-copy { padding-block: 2rem 0; } .back-link { margin-bottom: 3rem; } .hero-art { padding: 0 0 2rem; } .hero-art img { width: 100%; max-height: none; } h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 14vw, 5rem); } .split-section, .community-section { padding-block: 5rem; } .split-art { order: 2; } .section-heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; } .principles { padding-block: 5rem; } .principle-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .principle-grid article { min-height: auto; } .principle-grid img { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; } .team-section { padding-block: 5rem; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .button, .text-link { transition: none; } }
</style>
